            ("un communiqué", "uh(n) koh-mü-nee-KAY", "a statement; a press release", "Le communiqué annonce la date de la rencontre.", "The statement announces the meeting date."),
            ("une enquête", "ün ah(n)-KET", "a survey; an investigation", "L'enquête décrit sa méthode de collecte.", "The survey describes its collection method."),
